# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Waive / Backstop — configuration
#
# The model picker offers three engines, all free to the user (Waive supplies the
# keys/servers). All are optional: if none is reachable, the engine degrades
# gracefully to precomputed extractions + deterministic draft text.
#
#   1. Ollama (Waive API)  — the private DEFAULT. The Waive-hosted Ollama server,
#                            set via OLLAMA_BASE_URL (+ OLLAMA_API_KEY). Point this at
#                            your hosted server; nothing is stored or collected.
#   2. Claude (Anthropic)  — fastest/most accurate; set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.
#   3. Ollama (Local)      — the user's OWN machine at http://localhost:11434. Always
#                            available to anyone running Ollama; needs no env config.
#
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL doubles as the dev fallback for option 1 — left at localhost it
# simply coincides with option 3, so the default works out of the box on a dev box.
#
# Force a server-side default with LLM_PROVIDER=ollama | anthropic | ollama-local.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Provider: Claude (Anthropic) — the online path ──────────────────────────
# When ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set, the app uses Claude to read uploaded notices
# (images AND PDFs) and to explain/translate/draft. Get a key at
# https://console.anthropic.com. Offered in the picker when the key is present, but
# the Waive Ollama API stays the default — force one with
# LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic | ollama | ollama-local.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic

# Claude model. Default is the most capable. On a small credit budget, the cheaper
# claude-haiku-4-5 (~5x cheaper) or claude-sonnet-4-6 stretch credits much further.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# ── Provider: Ollama (Waive API / cloud) ────────────────────────────────────
# Base URL of the Ollama server behind the "Ollama (Waive API)" option. Point this at
# your hosted Waive server (or https://ollama.com for Ollama Cloud). Left at localhost
# it coincides with the "Ollama (Local)" option, so the default works on a dev box.
# The "Ollama (Local)" option always uses http://localhost:11434 regardless of this.
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434

# API key for Ollama Cloud (create at https://ollama.com/settings/keys).
# Leave EMPTY for a local server — no auth header is sent when this is blank.
OLLAMA_API_KEY=

# Model for VISION extraction of an uploaded notice image/PDF page. Must be multimodal.
# Local examples: llama3.2-vision, qwen2.5vl, llava
# Cloud examples: qwen3-vl:235b-cloud
MODEL_EXTRACT=llama3.2-vision

# Model for plain-language explanation, EN<->ES translation, and document drafting.
# Local examples: llama3.2, qwen2.5, mistral
# Cloud examples: gpt-oss:120b-cloud, qwen3-coder:480b-cloud
MODEL_DRAFT=llama3.2

# Request timeout (ms) for a single Ollama call before falling back to offline mode.
LLM_TIMEOUT_MS=60000

# Force offline mode (1 = never call Ollama, always use precomputed extractions).
# The app auto-falls-back to offline when Ollama is unreachable; this just forces it.
LLM_OFFLINE=0

# Which U.S. state / jurisdiction the `answer` (debt) pack is configured for.
# This build ships an ONTARIO (Canada) configuration. Informational only.
ANSWER_JURISDICTION=ON-CA
